			<div class="content" id="post-content-4475255">
									

<p>I've read many Agatha Christie novels when I was a child. Surely, one of the few &quot;classic&quot; authors that I can enjoy, even after all these years.</p>
<p>And this article is, for sure, a great pastiche. I had many questions after seeing some particular lines, I can imagine some personal &quot;answers&quot; to that and that's what I like.</p>
<p>So, +1.</p>

